ide it; its death spills the brood.", "frostbite": "Frostbite — rime-knuckled; its blows chill your stride to a crawl.", "warden": "Warden — its blows anchor you in place. Fight at range.", "thorned": "Thorned — every wound you open pricks back. Strike sparingly.", "nightmare": "Nightmare — it won't stay dead the first time. Kill it twice.", "hoarded": "Hoarded — it swallowed a blade whole; its death coughs it up.", "phantom": "Phantom — half-drowned in the veil; it blinks to your side.", "regal": "Regal — the court's own dead; it dies hard and pays royal.", "reaper": "Reaper — it smells the dying; wounded, you draw its blade.", "vampiric": "Vampiric — its blows drink your wounds to mend its own.", "adamant": "Adamant — no flinch lives in it; don't wait for it to stagger.", "shattered": "Shattered — cracked through; its fall breaks into smaller things.", "umbral": "Umbral — it smothers the light it stands in. Watch the dark.", "wispsborn": "Wispsborn — a wisp rides its ribs; its death sets it free.", "keelborn": "Keelborn — souls cling to its keel-bones; its death pays out.", "clamworn": "Clamworn — clam-plated; its fall leaves a snare behind.", "sirensong": "Sirensong — wounded, it sings; the song drags you to its mouth.", "pearlbound": "Pearlbound — pearl-plated; your first blow only cracks the shell."}[e.affix]), Color(0.6, 0.95, 0.7), true)
